  <!-- EN: bolter -->
  <BEWH_AstartesBolter.label>爆弹卡宾枪</BEWH_AstartesBolter.label>
  <!-- EN: The Mk Vb boltgun is the iconic standard-issue firearm of the Adeptus Astartes. Firing mass-reactive rounds with deadly efficiency, it combines reliability, adaptability, and stopping power, making it the definitive Space Marine weapon. \n\nAvalible Loadout: Standard, Inferno, Metal Storm -->
  <BEWH_AstartesBolter.description>爆弹卡宾枪是由星际战士使用的一款紧凑型速射枪械，发射爆矢。它轻巧灵活，射击威力强大，精准度极高，是近距离和中距离作战的理想选择。</BEWH_AstartesBolter.description>
  <!-- EN: stock -->
  <BEWH_AstartesBolter.tools.stock.label>枪托</BEWH_AstartesBolter.tools.stock.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <BEWH_AstartesBolter.tools.barrel.label>握把</BEWH_AstartesBolter.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: bolter -->
  <BEWH_AstartesBolter.verbs.Verb_ShootChangeableBullets.label>爆矢</BEWH_AstartesBolter.verbs.Verb_ShootChangeableBullets.label>
  
